## Lending Audit Checklist

### Oracle Security
- [ ] Chainlink or manipulation-resistant oracle used
- [ ] Price staleness checked
- [ ] Fallback oracle available
- [ ] Decimal handling correct

### Interest Accrual
- [ ] Interest accrued before every state change
- [ ] Rate model bounds reasonable
- [ ] No same-block borrow/repay exploitation
- [ ] Utilization calculation correct

### Liquidation
- [ ] Liquidation threshold properly set
- [ ] Liquidation bonus incentivizes liquidators
- [ ] Bad debt handling implemented
- [ ] No reentrancy during liquidation
- [ ] Partial liquidation works correctly

### Collateral Management
- [ ] Collateral factors appropriate per asset
- [ ] Factor changes timelocked
- [ ] Withdrawal checks health factor
- [ ] First depositor attack mitigated

### Access Control
- [ ] Admin functions protected
- [ ] Parameter changes bounded
- [ ] Emergency pause available
- [ ] Upgrade mechanism secure

### Token Compatibility
- [ ] Fee-on-transfer tokens handled
- [ ] Rebasing tokens considered
- [ ] Different decimals work
- [ ] Non-standard tokens reviewed
